{
  "key": 9402,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}. The\n",
        "mythical stage built to show respect\f",
        "for Arceus.\r",
        "It is said that people used to\n",
        "celebrate its magnificent might with\f",
        "music and dance.\r",
        "Some people in Johto still pass down\n",
        "this tradition.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}. The\n",
        "mythical stage built to show respect\f",
        "for Arceus.\r",
        "It is said that people used to\n",
        "celebrate its magnificent might with\f",
        "music and dance.\r",
        "Some people in Johto still pass down\n",
        "this tradition."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: The {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0} allows a\n",
        "single Arceus and nothing else to\f",
        "get on the stage...\r",
        "If you wish to go up there, you have\n",
        "to deposit your other Pokémon in\f",
        "a PC Box at the cabin."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Bring your Arceus instead.\r",
        "Any other Pokémon may get blown away\n",
        "by the strong power lingering\f",
        "at the ruins.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is where one might say,\n",
        "“The lead enters the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}\f",
        "at last.”\r",
        "All my study of ruins and Pokémon\n",
        "mythology in Sinnoh may have been\f",
        "to bring you up on this stage\f",
        "here today...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Depicted on the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}\n",
        "are the Pokémon that shaped\f",
        "this world.\r",
        "The circle in the middle is Arceus,\n",
        "the origin of it all...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: According to an ancient\n",
        "document, time, space, and antimatter,\f",
        "or what combined we call the world,\f",
        "shall be born when Arceus stands\f",
        "on the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is the pattern that\n",
        "represents Palkia, the master of\f",
        "space and dimensions...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is the pattern that\n",
        "represents Dialga, the guardian\f",
        "of time...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is the pattern that\n",
        "represents Giratina, the ruler of\f",
        "the world that is on the opposite side\f",
        "of ours, the world of antimatter...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Arceus has accepted you as\n",
        "a Trainer.\r",
        "Arceus, having shaped the world,\n",
        "is said to show you a glimpse of\f",
        "its true power.\r",
        "The power of possibly making life\n",
        "appear out of nothing...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: It seems that something\n",
        "will happen when you choose one\f",
        "of the circles...\r",
        "You’ll want to be well prepared."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Once you are ready, choose a\n",
        "circle and stand in the middle of it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: So you choose Dialga,\n",
        "the guardian of time? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: So you choose Palkia, the\n",
        "master of space and dimensions? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: So you choose Giratina,\n",
        "the ruler of the Distortion World? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: That shining sphere...\n",
        "Could it be...an Egg?\r",
        "Did we just witness the very moment\n",
        "an Egg was brought to this world?\f",
        "A moment no one has ever seen?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: An Egg is the cradle of every\n",
        "being. This planet itself is an Egg\f",
        "in a sense...\r",
        "Life that comes from an Egg will\n",
        "come to an end in due course...\f",
        "to begin anew...\r",
        "That may be what Arceus\n",
        "wanted to show us.\r",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00018",
      "en_US": "Cynthia: That was...?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: We seem to be surrounded by\n",
        "that strong power again...!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Of course... Arceus!\r",
        "So the source of the power I’ve felt\n",
        "was Arceus!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: What is now the {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins\n",
        "{COLOR 0}was built to honor Arceus by the\f",
        "Sinnoh people...\r",
        "It’s an icebound temple that has been\n",
        "waiting for Arceus for hundreds\f",
        "of years...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}.\r",
        "It is designed to bring out the power\n",
        "Arceus possesses.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Arceus is described in\n",
        "mythology as being the origin of\f",
        "everything and the source of\f",
        "all beings.\r",
        "It is said that the power of Arceus\n",
        "is released on the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: The {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins{COLOR 0} are what\n",
        "remains of a temple built to show\f",
        "respect for Arceus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "The mysterious round object\n",
        "took the shape of a Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtained\n",
        "the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00027",
      "en_US": "Will you choose Dialga? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00028",
      "en_US": "Will you choose Palkia? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00029",
      "en_US": "Will you choose Giratina? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00030",
      "en_US": "This place does not seem to respond..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "It seems that only a single Arceus\n",
        "can stand here..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to give a nickname\n",
        "to the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "It seems it no longer responds\n",
        "to this Arceus..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00034",
      "en_US": "Kyouuuun!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00035",
      "en_US": "Kyauun.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00036",
      "en_US": "Kyuuun...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00037",
      "en_US": "Gugyugubah!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00038",
      "en_US": "Gagyagyaah!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00039",
      "en_US": "Giygogagohgwooh!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00040",
      "en_US": [
        "The centre of the stage regulates\n",
        "the events of the Mystri Stage..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00041",
      "en_US": [
        "It detects that there are still\n",
        "Pokémon on the stage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00042",
      "en_US": [
        "The stage acknowledges your Earth\n",
        "Badge, and declares you strong\f",
        "enough to challenge the rulers of\f",
        "time, space and antimatter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00043",
      "en_US": "A"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00044",
      "en_US": [
        "As a reward for being able to capture\n",
        "it, Dialga rewards you with its special\f",
        "Orb.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00045",
      "en_US": "Dialga retreated into time..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00046",
      "en_US": "Palkia retreated into space..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00047",
      "en_US": [
        "Giratina retreated into an\n",
        "alternate dimension..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "As a reward for being able to capture\n",
        "it, Palkia rewards you with its special\f",
        "Orb.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00049",
      "en_US": [
        "As a reward for being able to capture\n",
        "it, Giratina rewards you with its special\f",
        "Orb.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00050",
      "en_US": "Azelf vanished..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00051",
      "en_US": "Mesprit vanished..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00052",
      "en_US": "Uxie vanished..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00053",
      "en_US": [
        "The stage determines if {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\n",
        "has accomplished the requirements to\f",
        "challenge the beginning and end of\f",
        "creation...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00054",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} was judged to {COLOR 1}not have the\n",
        "necessary items{COLOR 0} to continue the test."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00055",
      "en_US": [
        "The Egg produced gave out\n",
        "a blinding white light...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00056",
      "en_US": [
        "The otherworldly forces are\n",
        "satisfied with {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s achievements!\r",
        "You will have but {COLOR 1}one chance{COLOR 0} to\n",
        "challenge the creator.\r",
        "If you happen to have any Master Balls,\n",
        "you may use them, though it would\f",
        "destroy the challenge of the fight...\r",
        "Do you want to continue? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00057",
      "en_US": "Arceus: Dodogyuuun!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00058",
      "en_US": [
        "After {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} failed to capture it,\n",
        "Arceus left the Mystri Stage,\f",
        "never to be seen by mankind again..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00059",
      "en_US": [
        "After {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} captured Arceus,\n",
        "the stage began to collapse.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00060",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} hurried back to Cynthia, in\n",
        "an effort to escape the Sinjoh Ruins.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00061",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} and Cynthia teleported back\n",
        "to Johto, as the ruins collapsed,\f",
        "never again to be trespassed...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00062",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations to you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, for\n",
        "completing {COLOR 1}Pokémon Sacred Gold{COLOR 0} and\f",
        "{COLOR 2}Pokémon Storm Silver{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00063",
      "en_US": [
        "This is, if you hadn’t already\n",
        "figured it out, the {COLOR 1}bad ending{COLOR 0}.\r",
        "If you don’t reset now and try to\n",
        "capture Arceus, your playthrough will\f",
        "forever remain...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00064",
      "en_US": "...{COLOR 1}incomplete{COLOR 0}."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00065",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} was judged to {COLOR 1}not have\n",
        "sufficiently proven himself{COLOR 0} to\f",
        "continue the test."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00066",
      "en_US": "DEBUG 1\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00067",
      "en_US": "DEBUG 2\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00068",
      "en_US": "DEBUG 3\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00069",
      "en_US": "DEBUG 4\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00070",
      "en_US": "DEBUG 5\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00071",
      "en_US": "DEBUG 6\r"
    }
  ]
}
